OL,3,ARAF Fairford suspects released on bail,
OL,4,Ahead of counter-terror police says
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive men arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fterror offences near RAF Fairford on
OL,8,FSunday are released on bail, says the
OL,9,Fhead of UK counter terrorism policing
OL,11,FAssistant Commissioner Laurence Taylor
OL,12,Fsays the investigation is not over, and
OL,13,Fpolice are considering numerous angles,
OL,14,Fincluding if proxies working on behalf
OL,15,Fof a foreign state could have been
OL,16,Finvolved
OL,18,FThe men - all UK nationals in their 20s
OL,19,Fwho live in London - were arrested
OL,20,Funder the Explosives Act and on
OL,21,Fsuspicion of preparing a terrorist act
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
