OL,3,ARAF Fairford suspects released on bail,
OL,4,Ahead of counter-terror police says
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say they are "very aware of the
OL,7,Flevels of speculation about the
OL,8,Fmotivation behind this incident, and
OL,9,Fthe geopolitical questions that are
OL,10,Fbeing raised". The Iranian embassy in
OL,11,Fthe UK denies any involvement
OL,13,FMeanwhile, Home Secretary Shabana
OL,14,FMahmood says that the scene is safe and
OL,15,Fresidents will soon be allowed to
OL,16,Freturn home
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
