OL,3,ARAF Fairford suspects released on bail,
OL,4,Ahead of counter-terror police says
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier, a farmer who called 999 when
OL,7,Fshe saw "a large group of hooded and
OL,8,Fmasked men" said she "foiled" their
OL,9,Fplans. People living nearby say
OL,10,Fsecurity had been ramped up before the
OL,11,Farrests
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
