OL,3,AIran court upholds lashes sentence for
OL,4,Asinger who performed without hijab
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn appeals court in Iran has confirmed
OL,7,Fa sentence of 74 lashes handed to a
OL,8,Fprominent singer who performed without
OL,9,Fthe mandatory hijab, lawyers say.
OL,11,FParastoo Ahmadi sang while wearing a
OL,12,Fsleeveless dress during a concert
OL,13,Flivestreamed on her YouTube channel in
OL,14,FDecember 2024. Iran's laws ban public
OL,15,Fperformances by women and require them
OL,16,Fto wear headscarves and modest
OL,17,Fclothing.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
